{"id":"9c200c8ec3685766","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-numeration.md","title":"Numeration and Binumeration","display":"df-numeration — Numeration and Binumeration","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-numeration","aliases":["67-df-numeration"],"display":"df-numeration — Numeration and Binumeration","depends_on":["[[67-df-prim-provability]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_chapter":1,"source_label":"numerates, binumerates; Ch3 correct numeration","source_printed_pages":"7–8,43","source_pdf_pages":"18–19,54","source_proof_status":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-numeration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-numeration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-numeration — Numeration and Binumeration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"source_label","html":"numerates, binumerates; Ch3 correct numeration"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"7–8,43"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"18–19,54"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi(x)\">\\(\\xi(x)\\)</span> 为至多自由变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的算术公式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi(\\bar n)\">\\(\\xi(\\bar n)\\)</span> 为无捕获数词代入，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为标准算术模型。</li>\n<li>可推导性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Num}_S,\\mathrm{Binum}_S,\\mathrm{CorrectNum}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Num}_S,\\mathrm{Binum}_S,\\mathrm{CorrectNum}_S\\)</span> 均是元语言谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Num}_S(\\xi,X)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (n\\in X\\Longleftrightarrow S\\vdash\\xi(\\bar n)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Binum}_S(\\xi,X)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Num}_S(\\xi,X)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (n\\notin X\\Longleftrightarrow S\\vdash\\neg\\xi(\\bar n)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CorrectNum}_S(\\xi,X)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Num}_S(\\xi,X)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (S\\vdash\\xi(\\bar n)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\xi(\\bar n)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Num}_S(\\xi,X)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (n\\in X\\Longleftrightarrow S\\vdash\\xi(\\bar n)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Binum}_S(\\xi,X)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Num}_S(\\xi,X)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (n\\notin X\\Longleftrightarrow S\\vdash\\neg\\xi(\\bar n)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CorrectNum}_S(\\xi,X)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Num}_S(\\xi,X)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (S\\vdash\\xi(\\bar n)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\xi(\\bar n)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 pp.7–8 的 numeration/binumeration 是逐数可证明性条件，p.43 另定义 correct numeration。它们不同于“公式在标准模型中定义该集合”；正确 numeration 才额外要求标准真值对应。创建前目标册没有这些定义，而 Ch3 和呈示依赖性均需复用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-prim-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"可推导性见 [[67-df-prim-provability]]。$\\mathrm{Num}_S,\\mathrm{Binum}_S,\\mathrm{CorrectNum}_S$ 均是元语言谓词。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi(x)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi(\\bar n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Num}_S,\\mathrm{Binum}_S,\\mathrm{CorrectNum}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Num}_S(\\xi,X)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (n\\in X\\Longleftrightarrow S\\vdash\\xi(\\bar n)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Binum}_S(\\xi,X)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Num}_S(\\xi,X)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (n\\notin X\\Longleftrightarrow S\\vdash\\neg\\xi(\\bar n)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{CorrectNum}_S(\\xi,X)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Num}_S(\\xi,X)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (S\\vdash\\xi(\\bar n)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\xi(\\bar n)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1786,"backlinks":[{"id":"916ea8724331b0a4","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$g[S]$ 是源公理代码集；$\\sigma$ 遍历至多自由变量 $z$ 的算术公式。$\\mathrm{Num}_T,\\mathrm{Binum}_T$ 取 [[67-df-numeration]]，$\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma$ 取 [[67-df-formula-provability]]，$\\unlhd$ 取 [[67-df-interpretability]]。"},{"id":"422d9b41ae960a38","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$g$ 为固定标准编码，$\\sigma(z)$ 为至多自由变量 $z$ 的算术公式，$\\mathrm{Num}_T(\\sigma,g[S])$ 取 [[67-df-numeration]]。"},{"id":"66d369f34bec0254","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau\\in\\mathrm{PRFml}_A\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]$，并满足 [[67-df-numeration]] 的 $\\mathrm{Binum}_T(\\tau,g[T])$。$\\mathrm{PRFml}_A,\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1$ 取 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]。"},{"id":"3034781c857fdfd7","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 是一致原始递归公理呈示；$\\tau(z)\\in\\mathrm{PRFml}_A$ 是 $\\mathrm{Code}_g(T)$ 在 $T$ 中的双表示。其元语言谓词 $\\mathrm{Binum}_T$ 及相关接口见 [[67-df-numeration]]、[[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]、[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]。"},{"id":"0d1cb776524abeca","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Num}_T$ 见 [[67-df-numeration]]，$\\Sigma_1$ 见 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]，$\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}$ 为至多一个自由变量的算术公式集合。"},{"id":"b283932d44a857c0","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau(z)$ 是至多自由变量 $z$ 的算术公式，满足 [[67-df-numeration]] 的 $\\mathrm{Binum}_T(\\tau,\\mathrm{Code}_g(T))$；不假设 $\\tau$ 是 $\\Sigma_1$。"},{"id":"d8841239c5b611fa","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\sigma_1(z)\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[z]$，$\\mathrm{Num}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\sigma_1,g[S_1])$。$\\mathrm{Num}$ 取 [[67-df-numeration]]，$\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma$ 取 [[67-df-formula-provability]]，$\\unlhd$ 取 [[67-df-interpretability]]。"},{"id":"57d3217ac67bc5a6","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IA}_T,\\mathrm{ExistsIrred}_T,\\mathrm{Ax}_T,\\mathrm{Irred}_T,\\mathrm{REAx}$ 见 [[67-df-irredundant-axiomatization]]；$\\mathrm{Num}_T$、$\\mathrm{Indep}_T$ 见 [[67-df-numeration]]、[[67-df-independent-formula]]。"},{"id":"82b3aa308217ac57","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Num}_T,\\mathrm{CorrectNum}_T$ 见 [[67-df-numeration]]；$\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1$ 见 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]。"},{"id":"4acca08be2551459","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Num}_T$、$\\mathrm{Indep}_T$ 与 $\\Sigma_1,\\Pi_1$ 分别见 [[67-df-numeration]]、[[67-df-independent-formula]]、[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-numeration]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-numeration]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-PA]]；[[../67-df-numeration]]；[[../67-df-arithmetical-classes]]；[[../67-thm-craig-reaxiomatization]]；[[../67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]"}],"outgoing":["573b4c635ea6d91f"]}